{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hans","entities":{"2535477":{"renderings":[{"id":"d5cb762ff4f64fdd","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13894369"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"那一天，整日听著寂寥的笔声度过。其间，时不时也能听到啾啾的鸣叫声。他想，文鸟或许也是因寂寞才啼鸣的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在两根栖木之间，忽而飞往那边，忽而飞回这边，来来回回，片刻不停。丝毫看不出有什么不满的样子。","derivedFrom":{"value":"那一天，整日聽著寂寥的筆聲度過。其間，時不時也能聽到啾啾的鳴叫聲。他想，文鳥或許也是因寂寞才啼鳴的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在兩根棲木之間，忽而飛往那邊，忽而飛回這邊，來來回回，片刻不停。絲毫看不出有什麼不滿的樣子。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"3550819":{"renderings":[{"id":"3824eabc28e07cd6","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"4879120"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"刚才那是什么声音？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"3550836":{"renderings":[{"id":"6ae787e196ca2254","lang":"zh","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"4879138"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"这是什么的声音？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"10938373":{"renderings":[{"id":"9adbe0f4036cba57","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13893623"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"「我唱歌时常会跑调呢。」「这种情况叫做音癡喔。」","derivedFrom":{"value":"「我唱歌時常會跑調呢。」「這種情況叫做音癡喔。」","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}